        </style><div xmlns="" class="content_block"><h2 class="auth__title">Сводная таблица минимальных величин: МРОТ, БРВ, БВИП, пенсии и пособия</h2><div class="doc-snippet"><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfas40k95t/" data-dfa="dfas40k95t"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr2/"></a>В 2026 году МРОТ, БРВ, БВИП, минимальные пособия и пенсии выросли. С 1 июля 2026 года размер БВИП составляет 504 000 сумов, а с 1 сентября 2026 года МРОТ — 1 360 000 сумов, БРВ — 440 000 сумов. В&nbsp;справочнике –&nbsp;все актуальные минимальные показатели, которые используются при&nbsp;оплате труда, а также при расчете пособий,&nbsp;пенсий, штрафов, налогов и льгот. </div><div id="documentBody" class="content-common"><div align="center"><div class="table-wide scroller-wrapper"><div class="scroller table-scroller"><div class="scroller__container"><table width="100%" class="bdAll"><caption>Справочник минимальных величин: МРОТ, БРВ, БВИП, пенсии и пособия</caption><tbody><tr><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 11%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr10/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfasn4mrla/" data-dfa="dfasn4mrla"></a><strong>Дата введения</strong></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 11%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr11/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfasgwdhr1/" data-dfa="dfasgwdhr1"></a><strong>Базовая расчетная <nobr>величина (сум.)</nobr></strong></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 14.35%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr12/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfase4o3lo/" data-dfa="dfase4o3lo"></a><strong>Базовая величина исчисления <nobr>пенсии (сум.)</nobr></strong></p></td><td colspan="4" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr13/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfass7g43f/" data-dfa="dfass7g43f"></a><strong>Минимальный размер&nbsp;(сум.)</strong></p></td><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 11%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr14/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfas7nuvv7/" data-dfa="dfas7nuvv7"></a><strong>Регламенти<br>рующий<br>нормативно-правовой акт</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 12.92%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr15/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfasay0qna/" data-dfa="dfasay0qna"></a><strong>оплаты труда (МРОТ)</strong></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 11%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr16/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfasl3snsd/" data-dfa="dfasl3snsd"></a><strong>пенсии по&nbsp;возрасту</strong></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 11%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr17/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfastzaz8y/" data-dfa="dfastzaz8y"></a><strong>пособия инвалидам с&nbsp;детства</strong></p></td><td style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 11%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr18/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfaswa8gxl/" data-dfa="dfaswa8gxl"></a><strong>пособия престарелым и&nbsp;нетрудоспособным гражданам, не&nbsp;имеющим необходимого стажа работы</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 11%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr19/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfasv33gls/" data-dfa="dfasv33gls"></a>01.09.2026</td><td style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 11%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr20/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfasihi32y/" data-dfa="dfasihi32y"></a>440 000</td><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 14.35%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr21/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfaswe25rg/" data-dfa="dfaswe25rg"></a>504 000</td><td style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 12.92%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr22/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfasn4sx15/" data-dfa="dfasn4sx15"></a>1 360 000</td><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 11%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr23/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfaspgx4gg/" data-dfa="dfaspgx4gg"></a>983 000</td><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 11%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr24/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfasgfa506/" data-dfa="dfasgfa506"></a>1 083 000</td><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 11%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr25/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfash09rz9/" data-dfa="dfash09rz9"></a>1 083 000</td><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 11%;"><p><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr26/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfas0734aq/" data-dfa="dfas0734aq"></a>Указ Президента от 23.06.2026 <a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/backlinkanchor59/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/19816" class="link npd" target="_blank" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="19816">№ УП-115</a></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 11%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr27/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfasc7us41/" data-dfa="dfasc7us41"></a>01.07.2026</td><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 11%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr28/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfaswklkpw/" data-dfa="dfaswklkpw"></a>412 000</td><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 12.92%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr29/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfask1oy3x/" data-dfa="dfask1oy3x"></a>1 271 000</td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 11%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr30/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfas00apxk/" data-dfa="dfas00apxk"></a>01.08.2025</td><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 14.35%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr31/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfasxscmq3/" data-dfa="dfasxscmq3"></a>471&nbsp;000</td><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 11%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr32/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfasgxseph/" data-dfa="dfasgxseph"></a>918&nbsp;000</td><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 11%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr33/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfasztxfax/" data-dfa="dfasztxfax"></a>1&nbsp;012&nbsp;000</td><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 11%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr34/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfas890l9q/" data-dfa="dfas890l9q"></a>1&nbsp;012&nbsp;000</td><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 11%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr35/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfasglc3zm/" data-dfa="dfasglc3zm"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/backlinkanchor44/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/20185" class="link npd" target="_self" title="" moduleId="90" documentId="20185">№ УП-91</a>&nbsp;от&nbsp;02.06.2025</td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 11%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr36/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfasg3ru7i/" data-dfa="dfasg3ru7i"></a>01.07.2025</td><td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align: middle; text-align: center; width: 11%;"><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/bssPhr37/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/208375/dfas5blcye/" data-dfa=